      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate and dedicated veterinary team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently praise Dr. Lisa Lowenstein, Dr. Everett Lowenstein, and their clinic staff for delivering compassionate, highly personal veterinary care. Pet parents emphasize that the doctors take ample time to answer questions, explain medical options thoroughly, and offer reassuring guidance without making families feel rushed during consultations."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 26,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for diverse pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently highlight the veterinary team's gentle, patient approach when examining dogs, cats, senior pets, and even exotic animals like rabbits and reptiles. Clients note that anxious or timid animals remain remarkably calm throughout checkups and procedures, with staff treating every patient like their own family companion."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Accurate diagnoses and surgical care"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners report strong satisfaction with treatment outcomes across routine procedures, dental cleanings, orthopedic ACL treatments, and emergency surgical repairs. Clients appreciate prompt diagnostic evaluations and practical medical management that successfully resolve chronic issues and restore their pets to active health."
      }
    }
  ],
